[openai_compliance_data_input://<name>]
account = Account to use for this input.
endpoint = Select the endpoint to get data from.
index = (Default: default)
interval = Time interval of the data input, in seconds. (Default: 300)

[openai_compliance_logs_input://<name>]
account = Account to use for this input.
event_type = Please select one or more compliance log categories from the list. If the category you need is not listed, type it and add it as a new option.
index = (Default: default)
interval = Time interval of the data input, in seconds. (Default: 300)
start_time = Enter the start date for data ingestion in the format: YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ (e.g., 2025-08-01T00:00:00Z).
